{
  "slug": "insights",
  "name": "Insights",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Weekly and monthly pattern recognition across Obsidian journal entries. Reads your recent journals and surfaces what you might be missing: floor trends, recurring emotional patterns, habit streaks, and blind spots. Includes a life coach voice that pushes back on comfort zones, a therapist voice that names what you're avoiding, and optional advisory panel commentary. Companion to the daily-journal plugin.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `insights` (Use this skill when the user says /weekly, /monthly, asks for a weekly review, monthly review, or wants…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install insights@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/claude-insights`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
